<title>USA: Houston Exploration Co Q4 net rises to $0.20.</title>
<headline>Houston Exploration Co Q4 net rises to $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.20     loss	 $0.41</p>
<p> Net profit		 4,586     loss	 6,311</p>
<p> Revs			24,946		    9,898</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  23,333		   15,295</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.49     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,642     loss	   303</p>
<p> Revs			65,904		   41,209</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,532		   15,295</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and full-year 1995 results hurt by one-time $12 million charge in connection with reorganization.</p>
<p>NOTE: Giving effect to TransTexas and Soxco acquisitions and IPO proceeds as if consummated as of January 1, 1996, then 1996 full-year net was $15.1 million or $0.65 on revenues of $87.6 million.</p>
